:: VehVeh Fluxy Teacher (End)

(metadata:
"NPC", "VehVeh",
"title", "Regarding Your Ill Teacher",
"topicDetail", "Veh-Veh has pointed you to the Apesai school's lab, where you might synthesize some medicine for your teacher. The rest is up to you.",
)



