$cssColumnChild[

["I hope your teacher gets better soon,"]<VehVehLine| she says. ["If- when he does, tell him to come by and visit our school. A few magi would stop by from time to time, but most of them are engineers, not... you know, davehmars. Well, you're one, but your teacher's a //master//. He's a master, right? Or am I- I'm just talking again, aren't I? Sorry. Is there anything else?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
You nod. Your teacher is eager to get out of Apesai more than anything, but you don't have to mention that to Veh-Veh.
<br>
---
<ol>
($funcNPCTopics: "She has done enough for you today. Better make good use of her help.", "Again, much gratitude, Veh-Veh. Goodbye.")
